@startuml
!theme plain
|faculty| Faculty
|mpc| MPC
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:send: Course Packet Information Received;
:send: Design to Faculty;
|faculty|
:Faculty chooses the design;
|a_default|
repeat :identify content requiring copyright clearance and contact publisher;
:v1: condition  if need to Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added ({true, false}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:notify: Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added;
repeat while () is ([v1 = true]) not ([v1 = false])
|mpc|
repeat :calculate: Course Packet Cost;
:add: Bookstore margin to determine retail price;
:v2: condition  if Price of the Course Packet is finalized ({true, false}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:reconsider content to decrease price;
repeat while () is ([v2 = false]) not ([v2 = true])
:notify: Notify Bookstore of Course packet  Course number  Faculty name  and sections;
|a_default|
:end: Packet information notified to Bookstore;
stop
@enduml